 "operation": [
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.1 Initial Display and Creation Period (PC-02, PC-03)",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Defaults: Route-Based PR, Operational Month = system month + 1, All Logistics Partners; the plan is calculated on open.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Authorization configuration: VPLD Staff and VPLD Section Head may create PR; other users get view only (message no. 17).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "c.",
   "text": "Period: Month N+1 allowed (created in N-1). Month N only when System Master parameter = allowed (not configured: no. 4; not allowed: no. 5). Past: no. 6; after N+1: no. 7 (TBD, OP-04).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.2 Data Sources",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "table",
   "columns": [
    {
     "title": "Data",
     "width": 14
    },
    {
     "title": "Source",
     "width": 18
    },
    {
     "title": "Rule",
     "width": 24
    }
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "Monthly Cost",
     "E-Catalogue (Master Price) FIX",
     "priceForPR: covers the month, not expired, unique"
    ],
    [
     "Mileage Cost",
     "E-Catalogue (Master Price) KM",
     "Same lookup; IDR / Km"
    ],
    [
     "Working Days",
     "TMMIN Calendar",
     "Per operational month (per LP TBD, OP-02)"
    ],
    [
     "Order Sharing",
     "Master KPI (By Resources)",
     "Daily QTY per LP"
    ],
    [
     "Routes",
     "Master Route Percentage",
     "Active routes, % > 0, distance Km"
    ]
   ],
   "level": 2,
   "row_lines": "all"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.3 Route-Based Calculation (TBD confirmation, OP-01)",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "bullets",
   "items": [
    "Monthly orders = Order Sharing \u00d7 Working Days.",
    "Orders per route = monthly orders split by Route Percentage (largest remainder; ties by higher %, then code). Total below 100%: split proportionally (TBD, OP-07).",
    "Planned Cost = orders \u00d7 distance (Km) \u00d7 Mileage Cost (IDR/Km), rounded to IDR.",
    "Delivery Cost (IDR/Day) = \u03a3 Planned Cost \u00f7 Working Days; Monthly Delivery Cost = Fixed Cost + \u03a3 Planned Cost.",
    "Example DNX Dec 2026: 4 \u00d7 22 = 88 orders; DPCMR_CYKRW 15% = 14 orders \u00d7 57 Km \u00d7 2,700 = 2,154,600."
   ],
   "marker": "1.",
   "level": 3
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.4 PR Amount per Type",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Monthly PR - Fixed Cost: component FIX; amount = Monthly Cost; Mileage Cost shown as reference rate. After PO the Monthly Cost goes directly to SA (TBD, OP-06).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Route-Based PR: components ROUTE:{code} for routes with orders > 0 not yet in active PRs; amount = \u03a3 Planned Cost of those routes.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "c.",
   "text": "Errors per LP: calendar (no. 8), routes (no. 9), Order Sharing (no. 10 / 11), price (no. 12), amount <= 0 (no. 15).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.5 PR Sequence and Duplicate Components (PC-06 to PC-08)",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Sequence = MAX(PR_SEQ) of LP + Operational Month (all statuses) + 1; each PR has its own PR number; sequence > 1 stores PARENT_PR_NO = sequence 1.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Used components = components of PRs of LP + month whose status is not Rejected / Returned. FIX used: no. 13; all planned routes used: no. 14.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "c.",
   "text": "Previous PRs are never changed.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "table",
   "columns": [
    {
     "title": "Seq",
     "width": 5
    },
    {
     "title": "PR",
     "width": 14
    },
    {
     "title": "Content",
     "width": 30
    }
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "1",
     "DNX26121352",
     "FIX Monthly Cost (Waiting SH)"
    ],
    [
     "2",
     "DNX26121353",
     "ROUTE 10 routes, SH Skip (Waiting DpH)"
    ],
    [
     "3",
     "new",
     "ROUTE only D1_S1_D3 (new route)"
    ],
    [
     "-",
     "new FIX",
     "Blocked, no. 13"
    ]
   ],
   "level": 2,
   "row_lines": "all"
  },
  {
   "type": "column_break"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.6 Create PR (PC-10 to PC-12)",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "bullets",
   "items": [
    "Create PR (or Confirm in the pop-up): confirmation no. 19 with LPs, sequences, amounts, total and approval path.",
    "Loading indicator; for each LP recalculate and re-check sequence and components in the same transaction.",
    "Insert PR header, details, approval levels and history (Data Map). Sequence taken meanwhile: no. 20.",
    "Approval levels from the workflow configuration: levels up to the creator's level = Skip. VPLD Staff: SH -> DpH -> DH. VPLD Section Head: SH Skip, starts at DpH; SH cannot approve the PR.",
    "Success: no. 21; rows show 'Created {PR No} ({status})'. Failed LPs: no. 22. Exception: rollback, no. 25."
   ],
   "marker": "1.",
   "level": 3
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.7 PR Detail Pop-up",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Header info; route table (Route, Route %, Number of Orders, Working Days, Distance, Planned Cost, PR) or cost components for Fixed Cost; Total Cost. Scrolls with sticky header / footer.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Routes already in an active PR are grey ('In {PR No}'). Close; Confirm & Create PR enabled when the row is Ready and the user is authorized.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.8 Export",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
